{"product":{"id":7862414704683,"title":"Royal Dynasty Siberian Caviar","body_html":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003eAcipenser Baerii, an ancient species originating from the major Siberian river basins, are farmed sustainably today throughout Asia and Europe. Unlike many other fish farms located near cities and industrial centers, this caviar comes from sturgeon raised in clean environments and state-of-the-art facilities. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003eFarm-raised and produced in the mountains and lakes of the countryside, t\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003ehese Siberian sturgeon produce beautiful gems that exude an elegant buttery flavor. This\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003e chocolate brown to dark gray-colored Siberian caviar is a true delicacy developed by traditional caviar producers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003e. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003eHand-packed and quality checked for color, size, freshness, flavor and texture.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: small;\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThis Siberian caviar is produced from farm-raised Acipenser baerii sturgeon that undergo more than one maturation cycle, meaning they allow egg-reabsorption, resulting in larger, more decadent pearls. Delicately malossol-cured to highlight their natural flavor and texture. This caviar is super fresh production and low-salt, featuring softer pearls that melt on your palate, and chocolate colored pearls with occasional light gray highlights, delivering a refined, well-balanced taste of the sea.\u003c\/span\u003e \u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Caviar Star","product_type":"physical","created_at":"2026-03-30T13:27:02-04:00","handle":"dynasty-siberian-caviar","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:42-04:00","published_at":"2026-03-30T14:24:44-04:00","template_suffix":"caviar-variants","published_scope":"global","tags":"Black Caviar, Caviar, China, Chinese, Chinese Caviar, Classic Caviar, Siberian, Siberian Caviar, Sturgeon, Sturgeon Caviar","variants":[{"id":43846041763883,"product_id":7862414704683,"title":"1oz","price":"59.00","sku":"SSA1","position":1,"compare_at_price":"89.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"1oz","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-03-30T13:27:03-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:42-04:00","taxable":false,"barcode":"713336002609","grams":104,"image_id":35100559835179,"weight":0.23,"weight_unit":"lb","unit_price":"59.00","unit_price_measurement":{"measured_type":"weight","quantity_value":"1.0","quantity_unit":"oz","reference_value":1,"reference_unit":"oz"},"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":43846041796651,"product_id":7862414704683,"title":"2oz","price":"109.00","sku":"SSA2","position":2,"compare_at_price":"150.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"2oz","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-03-30T13:27:03-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:42-04:00","taxable":false,"barcode":"713336002616","grams":168,"image_id":35100559999019,"weight":0.37,"weight_unit":"lb","unit_price":"54.50","unit_price_measurement":{"measured_type":"weight","quantity_value":"2.0","quantity_unit":"oz","reference_value":1,"reference_unit":"oz"},"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_curren